Version Management is Now Fully Automatic:

🔄 **How Version Updates Work Now:**
- Versions automatically increment (+0.0.1) when code is merged to main branch
- GitHub Actions handles version bumping and creates releases
- No manual version editing required
- Version displays automatically in the app from app configuration

📱 **For Development Testing:**
- Version stays the same during development work
- Test your changes with instant updates via "SleepFactor Dev" app
- Version only changes when features are released to production

🚀 **For Production Releases:**
- Create a pull request to merge your tested changes to main
- GitHub Actions automatically increments version and builds production APK
- Download the new version from GitHub Releases
- Version number appears in Profile screen and release notes

💡 **No More Manual Version Management:**
- Old way: Manually edit 3 files and verify version display
- New way: Versions update automatically when you merge to main---
